            "text": "Reduce travel distances and minimise travel needs through urban planning measures, better transport planning processes and a coherent policy ecosystem."
          },
          {
            "id": "T-2",
            "text": "Improve public transport ridership through multimodal integration and steer demand away from private vehicles."
          },
          {
            "id": "T-3",
            "text": "Improve non-motorised access and infrastructure for a healthier and safer city."
          },
          {
            "id": "T-4",
            "text": "Transition to cleaner and greener vehicles and improve vehicle efficiency through finance, policy enablers, incentives and R&D."
          },
          {
            "id": "T-5",
            "text": "Transition to cleaner and greener freight services through policies, incentives and fleet management."
          },
          {
            "id": "T-6",
            "text": "A resilient urban transport system that avoids service disruption and damage to transport infrastructure during extreme weather."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
